ay","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119002","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"《复生者之咒》、《恐厄集》、《死诞之书》……还有精装版...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1310119003:0":{"key":"say:5:1310119003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这些书都与亡灵有关，法拉莫尔先生对亡灵的研究的确很深。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1310119004:0":{"key":"say:6:1310119004:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119004","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"咦？这里有封信……原来法拉莫尔是位亡灵猎人，这次是被白...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1310119005:0":{"key":"say:7:1310119005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"满满，怎么能随便看别人的信件呢！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1310119006:0":{"key":"say:8:1310119006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对不起……可满满也不是故意的，这封信就这么放在桌子上……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1310119007:0":{"key":"say:9:1310119007:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119007","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嚯，别管什么信了，他负责护卫祭典安全，干嘛非要让我们憋...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:10:1310119007":{"key":"choice_prompt:10:1310119007","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1310119007","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嚯，别管什么信了，他负责护卫祭典安全，干嘛非要让我们憋在屋子里。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1310119008:1":{"key":"say:11:1310119008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我们可不是手无寸铁的家伙！铁头说了，“没有活...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1310119009:0":{"key":"say:12:1310119009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1310119009","action_index":"0","choic